msgid "Accessible Carousel &amp; Slider"
msgstr ""

msgid "Plugin version"
msgstr ""

msgid "WCAG 2.2 AA carousel, slider and card-scroller blocks for WordPress — keyboard and screen-reader friendly, with a pause control and no autoplay."
msgstr ""

msgid "Built by Shivaji Mitra at %1$sAnanyoo%2$s, Kolkata, India."
msgstr ""

