msgstr ""

msgid "Ananyoo Accessible Blocks"
msgstr ""

msgid "Accessible Carousel"
msgstr ""

msgid "one slide at a time, with Previous / Next, slide dots and a pause control."
msgstr ""

msgid "Accessible Card Scroller"
msgstr ""

msgid "a horizontal row of cards that scrolls with the keyboard and Previous / Next buttons."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Hero Slide and Scroller Card blocks are added inside these two as their items."
msgstr ""

msgid "How to add one"
msgstr ""

msgid "Edit any post or page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Click the + inserter and search for \"Accessible\", or type %s in a new paragraph."
msgstr ""

msgid "Insert your slides or cards, then adjust options (cards per view, gap, arrows) in the block sidebar."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ready-made patterns are also available under the Patterns tab."
msgstr ""

msgid "Accessibility built in"
msgstr ""

msgid "No autoplay; an explicit pause / play control where motion is used."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full keyboard operation: Previous / Next reachable first, plus Left / Right arrow keys to change slides and Home / End to jump to the first or last slide."
msgstr ""

msgid "Screen-reader labels and a polite live region that announces each slide by its title."
msgstr ""

msgid "An in-editor Accessibility check flags weak colour contrast, missing alt text and vague button text as you build, with a live WCAG contrast readout."
msgstr ""

msgid "A visible slide counter and a \"Skip carousel\" link for keyboard users, plus Windows High Contrast (forced-colors) support."
msgstr ""

msgid "Non-visible slides are removed from the tab order, so there is no hidden focus trap."
msgstr ""

msgid "Honours the \"reduce motion\" setting and uses 44px minimum touch targets."
msgstr ""

msgid "Optional, off-by-default visitor modes: a \"View as list\" reading mode and a dyslexia-friendly reading toggle."
msgstr ""

